    "text": "If <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math> are two distinct integers and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></math> is a natural number then <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup></math> is divisible by",
