  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup></math> where <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math><br /><br />Then, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math> is divisible <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> is divisible <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math> is divisible <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math><br /><br />Hence <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup></math> is divisible <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math>",
